  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.558237,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is very pleasant in August to recline in Fleet Street, or wherever stern business keeps one, and to think of the sea.",
      "output_sha256": "264909a4dd949bd4b1d536552f99e9824d8a88c2ccce4aaca0601136e45f4fd4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "264909a4dd949bd4b1d536552f99e9824d8a88c2ccce4aaca0601136e45f4fd4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I find no envy for the throngs flocking to Margate and Blackpool, Salcombe and Minehead, for I've convinced myself that the sea has lost its charm since my youth.",
      "output_sha256": "1e7138c55cb717d39260df44fd891446da3d711414a1c9b0a157821701c58818",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.557601,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ff38d7e82a962f31c1d0d081bbceef38b2808dad5259831d1cdd114036e59c0a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e7138c55cb717d39260df44fd891446da3d711414a1c9b0a157821701c58818",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then the pools were always full of starfish; crabs—really big crabs—stalked the deserted sands; and anemones waved their feelers at you from every rock.",
      "output_sha256": "6c65a47b281f1a78196c2dae9155cf33970d6e9ce7afdbb0df05823cf1c43d11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c65a47b281f1a78196c2dae9155cf33970d6e9ce7afdbb0df05823cf1c43d11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While poets may claim the sea remains unchanged (and they might be correct regarding the water itself), I suspect the beaches are deteriorating.",
      "output_sha256": "75da6770089b10797ab2f0229aaa557cc040ffe26ab5456b1167e9038030ecd4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.444181,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3b751428ea5905e5e4e687016eb97dd2cc8cd7877818946e59a640097a17a5ec"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "75da6770089b10797ab2f0229aaa557cc040ffe26ab5456b1167e9038030ecd4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the last ten years I don't suppose I have seen more than five starfishes, though I have walked often enough by the margin of the waves —and not only to look for lost golf balls.",
      "output_sha256": "a67320cd005dffac0762f2a0cc278c37ad4aedd1e27dc415354b871a2808262a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "a67320cd005dffac0762f2a0cc278c37ad4aedd1e27dc415354b871a2808262a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There have been occasional belated little crabs whom I have interrupted as they were scuttling home, but none of those dangerous monsters to whom in fearful excitement, and as a challenge to one's companion, one used to offer a forefinger.",
      "output_sha256": "699405cfc68124f3f5569f1ca455e54fc481bfc03173b3f69eef11698c9cf3f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "699405cfc68124f3f5569f1ca455e54fc481bfc03173b3f69eef11698c9cf3f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I refuse regretfully your explanation that it is my finger which is bigger; I should like to think that it were indeed so, and that the boys and girls of to-day find their crabs and starfishes in the size and quantity to which I was accustomed.",
      "output_sha256": "9bc2f789e55649ee7a539f5212ee44f908a2612ac32a2610bfe58c6767a10651",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "9bc2f789e55649ee7a539f5212ee44f908a2612ac32a2610bfe58c6767a10651",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I am afraid we cannot hide it from ourselves that the supply is giving out.",
      "output_sha256": "b94965873a9639e49e89ad3cd996215bdeef48a0bb2bbee001062bc510f44042",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "b94965873a9639e49e89ad3cd996215bdeef48a0bb2bbee001062bc510f44042",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It’s clear that repeatedly collecting starfish to display as barometers in our homes detracts from the future generations' experience.",
      "output_sha256": "f0a37693cfbfa98fa513dd06b0d4bde2e5ae6e91d7625920c91f7bbd991e77ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.273421,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "82af5e08a67a87c8f9fb9e02df299ff2ce5475e0f07ecfbbe333cce4ebb9f2b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f0a37693cfbfa98fa513dd06b0d4bde2e5ae6e91d7625920c91f7bbd991e77ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We had another amusement as children, in which I suppose the modern child is no longer able to indulge.",
      "output_sha256": "e9e077c04e79f868a1eea1b310de26d9adb25dc040c7081329a9005bc1e9c2db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "e9e077c04e79f868a1eea1b310de26d9adb25dc040c7081329a9005bc1e9c2db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We used to wait until the tide was just beginning to go down, and then start to climb round the foot of the cliffs from one sandy bay to another.",
      "output_sha256": "3c19bc676f845b12427b2f3a91859aa9c1be306d66bdac437657df6db379ea03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c19bc676f845b12427b2f3a91859aa9c1be306d66bdac437657df6db379ea03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The waves lapped the cliffs, a single false step would have plunged us into the sea, and we had all the excitement of being caught by the tide without any of the danger.",
      "output_sha256": "05cc09da88b48e6409c62a66d5f996d943e6ac22ea9c287e0c8bdf5c7114e8a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "05cc09da88b48e6409c62a66d5f996d943e6ac22ea9c287e0c8bdf5c7114e8a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "On rare occasions, we were fortunate enough to see frantic figures at the cliff's summit, ignorant of the true nature of our adventure, believing we were in dire straits.",
      "output_sha256": "36dbd2c3bbf7e6252383dfa562d3ae3fd518ea2cc5c3710382ee9c93abcd868b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.293962,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e9579a387ff5f28760aeda1bcb77e7ca058d020bc5b42f5bd706a251fd0861fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36dbd2c3bbf7e6252383dfa562d3ae3fd518ea2cc5c3710382ee9c93abcd868b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Those moments were particularly exhilarating.",
      "output_sha256": "bf61ab0d5063b11b93a6cc5a95a53e2810f29fa0641735e6703d02ecc96ce4be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.293962,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e9579a387ff5f28760aeda1bcb77e7ca058d020bc5b42f5bd706a251fd0861fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bf61ab0d5063b11b93a6cc5a95a53e2810f29fa0641735e6703d02ecc96ce4be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But it was a very special day when that happened.",
      "output_sha256": "23b6dbabefa8426d394f0778a0322d4ba3d6dcbf37a5e25f420e6d5bbd4718a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "23b6dbabefa8426d394f0778a0322d4ba3d6dcbf37a5e25f420e6d5bbd4718a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have done a little serious climbing since those days, but not any which was more enjoyable.",
      "output_sha256": "b0f7f5afa8cdc9a2b4c82de0cde5232624c4801bbf4801f44dec9c15711f8f3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "b0f7f5afa8cdc9a2b4c82de0cde5232624c4801bbf4801f44dec9c15711f8f3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The sea was never more than a foot below us and never more than two feet deep, but the shock of falling into it would have been momentarily as great as that of falling down a precipice.",
      "output_sha256": "27f27ef417d8511bd21127547e1dc8ec027209e042cbc13cd578a5d82f07df35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "27f27ef417d8511bd21127547e1dc8ec027209e042cbc13cd578a5d82f07df35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Thus, we enjoyed the dual pleasures of climbing—the physical satisfaction of the ascent and the exhilarating relief when your heart settled back into its normal rhythm.",
      "output_sha256": "806528fb452fdf179be148a841111b36b2c86361e48d6ee748d01114743e43c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.391208,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e20ce2a7d27014010e428bc802ac013ebc5bf879358d21895a63cfae182c57bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "806528fb452fdf179be148a841111b36b2c86361e48d6ee748d01114743e43c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Moreover, you couldn't meet your demise, and if you faced an impassable obstacle, you could simply wait for the tide to drop and reveal a new foothold.",
      "output_sha256": "dfef08dd096840cdde48e011ae42ec2163c38c12c4d731458135361e5bb3abb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.337752,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d216625383f97ff9fe00206a90152b386f9e81756cf806fc4fed2dc875733106"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dfef08dd096840cdde48e011ae42ec2163c38c12c4d731458135361e5bb3abb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But, as I say, these are not joys for the modern child.",
      "output_sha256": "3e74030ddb0a6572583ecad96cfbd8362a245271d66be07d4bf5ea705967463c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e74030ddb0a6572583ecad96cfbd8362a245271d66be07d4bf5ea705967463c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The tides may not retreat as reliably as they once did, or perhaps the cliffs have altered in form and quality.",
      "output_sha256": "8dd85fafdfe3fdc3bb271ecd41ab60b44a4ee377b3ab03f2387ddac8ac2830d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.298155,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "077fc7bd620139c6be54802d4ab7dfc826490c7a47aa26e1428ec087bb8369c9",
        "770121cb153c644a51da241544a46b93083e258f261c72a0a1fdc648b0fbbf80"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8dd85fafdfe3fdc3bb271ecd41ab60b44a4ee377b3ab03f2387ddac8ac2830d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Or people are no longer so ignorant as to mistake the nature of your position.",
      "output_sha256": "9e8e9850c2fc841c9a823b89355b655b9c9f3d09057fccb5f0bc4cc6b1625893",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e8e9850c2fc841c9a823b89355b655b9c9f3d09057fccb5f0bc4cc6b1625893",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One way or another I expect I do better in Fleet Street.",
      "output_sha256": "4da10e0c8e73e8978d485d1168feb68245e3a097757ac874c8439d26e7cea7e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "4da10e0c8e73e8978d485d1168feb68245e3a097757ac874c8439d26e7cea7e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I shall stay and imagine myself by the sea; I shall not disappoint myself with the reality.",
      "output_sha256": "0d7601a2cf22b35d602174b38359e478a43d251fc9bcd0cb4920f6f4a0465679",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d7601a2cf22b35d602174b38359e478a43d251fc9bcd0cb4920f6f4a0465679",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In my mind's eye, I escape the noise of bands and piers; a band playing by a moonlit shore evokes a sense of adulthood, while the beach and the remaining crabs summon the spirit of childhood, creating a conflict that can easily lead to discontent.",
      "output_sha256": "f35e136f54a2d6e06ad76d4e5e1e0c6d2280da8cc80fdbacfc61beb85154a5a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.392661,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f258062b2a82a913d0f231e119508b8eeed1a28d3690e74cca3cbe9a03dd2872"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f35e136f54a2d6e06ad76d4e5e1e0c6d2280da8cc80fdbacfc61beb85154a5a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I can see myself with a spade and bucket being extraordinarily happy.",
      "output_sha256": "ef69e4460404fbb69db1c5950c46e02a2085d926cadf13a7932c2a31ede6d704",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef69e4460404fbb69db1c5950c46e02a2085d926cadf13a7932c2a31ede6d704",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The other day I met a lucky little boy who had a pile of sand in his garden to play with, and I was fortunate enough to get an order for a tunnel.",
      "output_sha256": "61c67d62e7deeace9428601b684a9aa26702cf8f197905162cfc0dc518f25ebb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "61c67d62e7deeace9428601b684a9aa26702cf8f197905162cfc0dc518f25ebb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The tunnel which I constructed for him was a good one, but not so good that I couldn't see myself building a better one with practice.",
      "output_sha256": "ea49ae32433ceac2dfa938bf63878c9553f79e91c3cc1cee8950cbd420274112",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea49ae32433ceac2dfa938bf63878c9553f79e91c3cc1cee8950cbd420274112",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I left with aspirations of becoming an architect; if I return to the sea, I will construct a proper tunnel, and then—who knows what else?",
      "output_sha256": "eeb51a74aec716be00326b273d4bf567adfe6c4c59b476781c38e7f3df136e29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.436996,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "79bdb27964c648fce75653a71137dace3cc2c2abd0091e38ee8dd0acac6d7027",
        "f21906baf650e8ffd62a4d7a3887c00a783ca046cdcbfaec83ceb865a88013e2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eeb51a74aec716be00326b273d4bf567adfe6c4c59b476781c38e7f3df136e29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At the moment I feel in tremendous form.",
      "output_sha256": "de366584b55d97c4e94704763d7d34b49450150cc93231677ce9bfd84a49ff35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "de366584b55d97c4e94704763d7d34b49450150cc93231677ce9bfd84a49ff35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Presently, I feel invigorated, as if I could create a cathedral.",
      "output_sha256": "743ede6b87b60bacc4d30d294afe37a860304719cc6d4d955df8ea05613c0053",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.558237,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b80b8609d4384d066ad9c8b27a4278dafa421d9807975b34fff15bfab6449982"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "743ede6b87b60bacc4d30d294afe37a860304719cc6d4d955df8ea05613c0053",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Nevertheless, there remains one aspect of childhood joy that is forever elusive: the sheer delight of getting soaked in the sea.",
      "output_sha256": "712407efd50fd3c87c05c3b17e2154ca6433d2934cb4f40f240aec315bebd413",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.511397,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a156b6b332e7822374120baa551f37d439f0567d24f461f4f37a869461a83576"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "712407efd50fd3c87c05c3b17e2154ca6433d2934cb4f40f240aec315bebd413",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is a statue not so far from Fleet Street of the man who introduced Sunday schools into England, but the man whom boys and girls would really like to commemorate in lasting stone is the doctor who first said that salt water couldn't give you a cold.",
      "output_sha256": "77fa3a7ef3c6ce23fea81a4532693c656cf1ac25d25d10cc199c2c9f4e4bb435",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "77fa3a7ef3c6ce23fea81a4532693c656cf1ac25d25d10cc199c2c9f4e4bb435",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whether this was true or not I do not know, but it was a splendid and never-failing retort to anxious grown-ups, and added much to the joys of the seaside.",
      "output_sha256": "8221d04d4d84a366a66365347539a3abda5a615ddb0701e244d3b611434f6945",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "8221d04d4d84a366a66365347539a3abda5a615ddb0701e244d3b611434f6945",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But it is a joy no longer possible to one who is his own master.",
      "output_sha256": "be850f37e82b7a9a5ed2e21ed6f0fc51b2d907b033398e13a53adeb22fde5edd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "be850f37e82b7a9a5ed2e21ed6f0fc51b2d907b033398e13a53adeb22fde5edd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I, for instance, can get my feet wet in fresh water if I like; to get them wet in salt water is no special privilege.",
      "output_sha256": "a1235017c16d3b03660630581c448c8a8375c3f6d9ee92b7c1304cbd5db5d037",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1235017c16d3b03660630581c448c8a8375c3f6d9ee92b7c1304cbd5db5d037",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Feeling as I do, writing as I have written, it is sad for me to know that if I really went to the sea this August it would not be with a spade and a bucket but with a bag of golf clubs; that even my evenings would be spent, not on the beach, but on a bicycle riding to the nearest town for a paper.",
      "output_sha256": "323dbac28b4a9a96e19e281aed8f7792830c3f1d750a0ff5b4884b6ce8c6dd5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "323dbac28b4a9a96e19e281aed8f7792830c3f1d750a0ff5b4884b6ce8c6dd5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, you cannot convince me that my affection for the sea has waned or that I no longer find joy in the innocent pleasures of childhood.",
      "output_sha256": "f0dec5af58e7935538b685c4eb93c4f49d431addd3424edeb12308fe0a554ea8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.390379,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "842d003598d398d2e0fb2398d3bd891f8f9bc526dd22a0ab83fa90950d0632f8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f0dec5af58e7935538b685c4eb93c4f49d431addd3424edeb12308fe0a554ea8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I shall maintain that it is the sea which is not what it was, and that I am very happy in Fleet Street thinking of it as it used to be.",
      "output_sha256": "6fd48612c67a005bfc28f4ade9f4d2c659e639886d26508633c2ee7e94acdeb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "6fd48612c67a005bfc28f4ade9f4d2c659e639886d26508633c2ee7e94acdeb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
